@startuml k9x_filters_ap_flow
title An AP payment on K9-AIF with OpenAI agents: built today, and the last check designed

actor "AP clerk\n(page)" as Clerk
participant "K9EventRouter" as Router
queue "Kafka\n(Redpanda)" as Kafka
participant "APOrchestrator" as Orch
participant "Squad\nap_invoice" as Squad
participant "InvoiceAgent\n(OpenAI agent)" as Inv
participant "APRulesAgent\n(K9X Rules Engine)" as Rules
participant "PaymentAgent\n(OpenAI agent)" as Pay
participant "K9X HIL" as HIL
actor "Approver" as Appr
participant "k9x Origin\n(over MCP)" as Origin
database "Systems of record" as SoR

Clerk -> Router : invoice
Router -> Kafka : openai.ap.in
Kafka -> Orch : execute_flow (Zero Trust)
Orch -> Squad : run ap_invoice
Squad -> Inv : execute(payload)
note right of Inv
  k9x Shield, then Guardian, then the OpenAI run
  (planned on this page: K9X Filters in first,
  text_normalize; measured below)
end note
Inv --> Squad : vendor, invoice, amount
Squad -> Rules : facts
Rules --> Squad : needs_approval
Squad -> Pay : execute
Pay -> Pay : pay_invoice needs approval:\nthe OpenAI run pauses
Pay --> Squad : RequiresHIL
Squad --> Orch : RequiresHIL
Orch -> Kafka : hil.requests.openai-ap-payments
Kafka -> HIL : review task (invoice PDF)
Appr -> HIL : Approve
HIL -> Kafka : hil.replies.openai-ap-payments
Kafka -> Router : reply (claimed once)
Router -> Orch : resume
Orch -> Squad : resume at PaymentAgent
Squad -> Pay : continue the paused run

== Designed for this demo (the framework part is built and shown in K9X Streams) ==

Pay -> Origin : get_current(vendor), get_current(invoice)\n(verify against the system of record)
Origin -> SoR : read-through / verify
Origin --> Pay : facts with as_of, version, flags
Pay -> SoR : pay_invoice MCP tool\n(..., vendor_version, invoice_version)
alt versions unchanged, no hold
  SoR --> Pay : paid
else changed, or a hold placed
  SoR --> Pay : refused: what changed
  Pay --> Squad : not paid
  Squad --> Orch : a new review
end
@enduml
